  "notes": [
    "Source-only rationale:earlier scalar training identity/wave outputgradient RMS15.426531 showed strong semantics. A clean-local quadratic fixes reference geometry instead of backpropagating both nonlinear displaced features/posteriors. This is an independent falsification hypothesis;no current parameter target scores used to set it.",
