    "CacheJ shape63000x3x6x2x256 float32=2322432000bytes/arm plus sourcefeatures120960000bytes.493 batches128/3F=1479 Fforwardcalls/189000IQ;8874 pullbackcalls/1134000samplecoordinates. Cache training-only,detached,paired by originalphysical index;no Hessian/update.",
    "Featurearm usesmean3F(localfeaturesquared+.3exactT2KL);posteriorarm usesmean3F(exactcos+.3localposteriorsquared). Local=sum6(Jclean@(estimate-clean))². Original IQNMSE+.1logpower and per_frame_cap preserved. Neither full160Jacobian nor finite-error guarantee;posterior stabilization explicitly recorded.",
    "OriginalR03strictinit,2140840params,E10/2470,63000 sourceL/U,oldroutes/order,observed+clean,resetAdamW3e-5/warm247/cos3e-6/WD1e-4/clip1/FP32. One restorer seed;no failed/control init. Inference originalR03network only,no J/F/clean/RX/scene/update.",
