    "50focused testsPASS:finite differences,batchindependence,fixedprojection,allclassposterior symmetry/stability,quadraticgradient,onecomponentreplacement,sourcepairalignment,NumPyABI-independentbuffer,checkpoint/protocol/truthlast. One independentP0/P1reviewPASS with independent50checks.",
    "Launcherfirst realR03/3F/fourLs noquerysmoke with actual localJ,originalnativeIQgrad/coarsecorrmergedgrad/Fnograd/checkpointroundtrip;0TX/V/target/optimizer;PASSimmediatelytrains. OneordinaryaccountpreflightVERIFIED GPU6/7empty24124MB;parameter target4/5actualLIVEpreserved;>12GBdisk.",
